# Patterns to ignore when building packages.
#
# A subchart is loaded as its own chart, so the umbrella's .helmignore does not
# reach in here. Without this file, rendered output parked under templates/ is
# read back as a template on the next render — Helm passes plain YAML through
# untouched, so the manifest doubles every time and helm install applies the
# stray copy for real. Keep this list in step with the root .helmignore.
# VCS
.git/
.gitignore
# Test / session artifacts
*.png
*.log
dist/
# OS / IDE
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
# Rendered output
rendered*.yaml
out*.yaml
manifest*.yaml
*.rendered.yaml
*.out.yaml
